"اگر وہ چاہے", "bn": "যদি তিনি ইচ্ছা করেন", "fa": "اگر بخواهد"}}, {"text": "يُذْهِبْكُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَيَأْتِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "بِخَلْقٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "جَدِيدٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "74:55", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5550.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "So whosoever will may heed.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Dileyen onu düşünür.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "تو جو چاہے اس سے نصیحت لے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Maka barangsiapa menghendaki, niscaya dia mengambil pelajaran daripadanya (Al Quran).", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَمَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "شَآءَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/8f9a27096320931d4524.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "hoće", "en": "wills", "tr": "dilerse", "fr": "veut", "id": "menghendaki", "ur": "چاہے", "bn": "ইচ্ছা করে", "fa": "بخواهد"}}, {"text": "ذَكَرَهُۥ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "56:65", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5044.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "If We willed, We verily could make it chaff, then would ye cease not to exclaim:", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Dileseydik, onu kuru bir çöp yapardık. Hayret eder dururdunuz.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "ہم چاہیں تو اسے روندن (پامال) کردیں پھر تم باتیں بناتے رہ جاؤ", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Kalau Kami kehendaki, benar-benar Kami jadikan dia hancur dan kering, maka jadilah kamu heran dan tercengang.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "لَوْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "نَشَآءُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/df5c05baa329dfaa0ff6.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "we wish", "bs": "hoćemo", "tr": "isteriz", "fr": "nous voulons", "id": "kami menghendaki", "ur": "ہم چاہتے ہیں", "bn": "আমরা চাই", "fa": "می‌خواهیم"}}, {"text": "لَجَعَلْنَٰهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "حُطَٰمًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَظَلْتُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَفَكَّهُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "25:51", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2906.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "If We willed, We could raise up a warner in every village.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "(Habibim!) Şayet dileseydik elbette her köye bir uyarıcı (peygamber) gönderirdik.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور ہم چاہتے تو ہر بستی میں ایک ڈر سنانے والا بھیجتے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan andaikata Kami menghendaki benar-benarlah Kami utus pada tiap-tiap negeri seorang yang memberi peringatan (rasul).", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَلَوْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "شِئْنَا", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/adbd9b5ef77c0e5c7b08.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "we wished", "bs": "htjeli smo", "tr": "istedik", "fr": "nous avons voulu", "id": "kami telah menghendaki", "ur": "ہم نے چاہا", "bn": "আমরা চেয়েছিলাম", "fa": "خواستیم"}}, {"text": "لَبَعَثْنَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فِى", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كُلِّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "قَرْيَةٍ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "نَّذِيرًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "50:35", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/4665.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "There they have all that they desire, and there is more with Us.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Orada onlara ne isterlerse vardır. Katımızda daha fazlası da vardır.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "ان کے لیے ہے اس میں جو چاہیں اور ہمارے پاس اس سے بھی زیادہ ہے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Mereka di dalamnya memperoleh apa yang mereka kehendaki; dan pada sisi Kami ada tambahannya.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "لَهُم", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَشَآءُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/1425c813892468f0318b.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "they wish", "bs": "hoće", "tr": "isterler", "fr": "ils veulent", "id": "mereka menghendaki", "ur": "وہ چاہتے ہیں", "bn": "তারা চায়", "fa": "می‌خواهند"}}, {"text": "فِيهَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَلَدَيْنَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مَزِيدٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "81:29", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/5829.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And ye will not, unless (it be) that Allah willeth, the Lord of Creation.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Âlemlerin Rabbi olan Allah dilemeyince, siz dileyemezsiniz.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور تم کیا چا ہو مگر یہ کہ چاہے اللہ سارے جہان کا رب،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Dan kamu tidak dapat menghendaki (menempuh jalan itu) kecuali apabila dikehendaki Allah, Tuhan semesta alam.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَمَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَشَآءُونَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/5f7c9715d9768fd4a711.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "you (all) wish", "bs": "hoćete", "tr": "istiyorsunuz", "fr": "vous voulez", "id": "kalian menghendaki", "ur": "تم سب چاہتے ہو", "bn": "তোমরা চাও", "fa": "می‌خواهید"}}, {"text": "إِلَّآ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَشَآءَ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/dd03f7ab3d0250d1034c.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "he/it wishes", "bs": "hoće", "tr": "ister", "fr": "qu'il veuille", "id": "dia menghendaki", "ur": "وہ چاہے", "bn": "সে চায়", "fa": "بخواهد"}}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَبُّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْعَٰلَمِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "يَشَآءُ", "count": 108, "first": "2:90", "audio": "audio/cf31004939bc344221f8.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": [], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it wishes", "bs": "hoće", "tr": "ister", "fr": "il veut", "id": "dia menghendaki", "ur": "وہ چاہتا ہے", "bn": "সে চায়", "fa": "می‌خواهد"}}, {"arabic": "شَآءَ", "count": 56, "first": "2:20", "audio": "audio/09643d12f9b9ad859cb2.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"bs": "hoće", "en": "wills", "tr": "dilerse", "fr": "veut", "id": "menghendaki", "ur": "چاہے", "bn": "ইচ্ছা করে", "fa": "بخواهد"}}, {"arabic": "نَشَآءُ", "count": 11, "first": "7:100", "audio": "audio/bf91c1ab40b683b2fcaa.m4a"